      "uid": "zhcn:60f2b562a1c45b867ce501fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放，\n她所处的世代，\n有着众多才能顶尖的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1dc3f6cd88fd7cc487efe0f25b6745ff257efc64de0699e55c525fa6eb55feb",
